{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo with up to 12 bots, or connect a controller to enable local multiplayer with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/1c967016c40996b52d3e5560dbbbcb69.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1560 height=642 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >7 Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/75fae72a2818c9b446834abe7b44eba6.poster.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/75fae72a2818c9b446834abe7b44eba6.webm?t=1767651410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture the Flag - </strong>Fight for a single flag and return it to the capture zone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Practice - </strong>Compete for the most target hits or play solo and hunt for a 5x hit combo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Pickup - </strong>Smash your opponent into pixels and rush to collect them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Point - </strong>Reach the control points and secure them for 25 points each. Progress is faster in Hard difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orb - </strong>Hit the orb into the goal for 10 points. The next goal line respawns on the opposite side of the map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss - </strong>Defeat the boss by depleting their health meter with multiple stomps. They can evade attacks using a special teleport ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puck - </strong>Eliminate opponents using only the puck. Includes 8 powerups with special abilities and streak multipliers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/4c6b2bf1f2b128c9e0006447c625ad9a.poster.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/4c6b2bf1f2b128c9e0006447c625ad9a.webm?t=1767651410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Particle Scatter - </strong>Break into pixels to evade stomps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puck - </strong>Throw a puck to stun your opponent; press down to drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Time - </strong>Go half speed at any time, with no limits.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6 Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/522ed69d5727d4e887de50350029119f.poster.avif?t=1767651410\" width=1170 height=626 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961650/extras/522ed69d5727d4e887de50350029119f.webm?t=1767651410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Side - </strong>The home map with a simple and straightforward layout. Half city, half countryside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle - </strong>A quiet castle on the river, designed for flag fortification.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowy Day - </strong>Cozy city suburb featuring a hockey rink mini-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooftop - </strong>A busy street separates an expanding business district.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yacht - </strong>Ahoy! Battle on the deck of a moonlit yacht. Equip the scuba mask for a fast getaway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moon Base</strong> - Explore the underground moon facility or float across the surface in low gravity.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Player Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect a controller and add a second player to the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"2x Target Multiplier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961650/18aa1d22a46a15e5f6956be34c6fb497c845efcf.jpg"},{"name":"3x Target Multiplier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961650/9507ed9506214033ffa8eaad956a3127986284a0.jpg"},{"name":"4x Target Multiplier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961650/e334e020b5011f64aa520f42acd1579829af468a.jpg"},{"name":"5x Target Multiplier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961650/8e151d8ae113f304cc7f0cd7466d648b6c624f76.jpg"},{"name":"Boss (Easy)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961650/e7a7ee8cb41464f92e827d7ad059b7fe03ed92ea.jpg"},{"name":"Boss (Medium)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961650/2dea713972ae8457c513d79a96a178c026d3c2e3.jpg"},{"name":"Boss (Hard)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961650/0648551dfc21518223bd8b560ed7d076eea9d18e.jpg"},{"name":"Orb of Tranquility","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961650/74f74cfe75aad72b23611a3076ee879d13c1a2e6.jpg"},{"name":"Orb of Ponderance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3961650/82143b6516858b17b491086b0cd5fa2bd502c57d.jpg"},{"name":